=== GALA Pointer Semantics Test ===

Linked list (immutable values, mutable pointers):
  Node 0: value = 10
  Node 1: value = 20
  Node 2: value = 30

Before mutation: node1.next.value = 20
After mutation: node1.next.value = 999

Val pointer to mutable: *ptr = 100, data = 100

Before reassign: *ptr = 10
After reassign: *ptr = 20

Before: holder1.next.value=100, holder2.next.value=100
After: holder1.next.value=999, holder2.next.value=999

Same object pointers equal: true
Different object pointers equal: false

Original: value=42, next=<nil>
Copied: value=42, next=<nil>

Original node1.next.value: 20
Copied node1.next.value: 20
Same next pointer (shallow copy): true

Immutable list as a sealed type:
  values = 10 20 30

Read-only access by value:
  Team leader: Alice
  Leader name via function: Alice
  Member count: 5

=== All tests completed ===
